<tr><td>12</td><td>i = 10</td><td>read &amp; write</td></tr>
<tr><td>13–15</td><td>static block → m1() → print j</td><td>`0` (j still default) then `Base static block`</td></tr>
<tr><td>16</td><td>j = 20</td><td>read &amp; write</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr><th>Step</th><th>Action</th><th>Output / effect</th></tr>
<tr><td>17</td><td>x = 100</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>18–20</td><td>first static block → m2() → print y</td><td>`0` then `Derived first static block`</td></tr>
<tr><td>21</td><td>second static block</td><td>`Derived second static block`</td></tr>
<tr><td>22</td><td>y = 200</td><td></td></tr>
</table>
