<tr><th>Step</th><th>Action</th><th>Output</th></tr>
<tr><td>23–24</td><td>m2() → print y</td><td>`200` (now assigned)</td></tr>
<tr><td>25</td><td>print &quot;Derived main&quot;</td><td>`Derived main`</td></tr>
</table>
